producer_transport_consumer = "ABI-packed calldata reaches the production dynamic wrapper and real staking/bank keepers; signed EVM transactions prove ordinary bounded refusal and balance/validator rollback, direct calls prove refusal precedes payment, and a valid Ed25519 key creates a real validator and delegation."
